WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.746 --> 00:00:08.977
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Who’s that?

2
00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:11.994
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> That’s my sister, Lena.

3
00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.496
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> How old is she?

4
00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.100
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She’s 30, look at the cake!

5
00:00:18.787 --> 00:00:23.051
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Oh yeah! Nice cake! Does she also live in the UK?

6
00:00:23.471 --> 00:00:27.599
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> Yes, she does. She lives in London too, quite near me.

7
00:00:27.817 --> 00:00:31.870
It’s great, because the rest of my family are all in Germany.

8
00:00:32.756 --> 00:00:34.062
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> What does she do?

9
00:00:34.317 --> 00:00:35.683
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She’s a journalist.

10
00:00:35.743 --> 00:00:37.995
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Oh right. Is she married?

11
00:00:38.355 --> 00:00:44.315
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She has a partner, Sam. He’s English. He works for an IT company.

12
00:00:45.246 --> 00:00:50.290
And this is my brother Stefan with my nephew, Leon.

13
00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.361
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Ahh! How old is he?

14
00:00:52.406 --> 00:01:00.813
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> Leon? About one. They live in Berlin – I don’t see them very often, unfortunately.

15
00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:03.665
Stefan is a great dad!

16
00:01:04.311 --> 00:01:05.512
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> So what does he do?

17
00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:06.743
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> He’s a chef.

18
00:01:11.802 --> 00:01:13.723
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Is that another sister?

19
00:01:14.519 --> 00:01:18.602
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> No, that’s my cousin, Nadya, and her husband Alex.

20
00:01:20.343 --> 00:01:22.760
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> She looks very like Lena!

21
00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:26.513
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> Yes, maybe in that photo!

22
00:01:27.399 --> 00:01:28.915
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> So what does Nadya do?

23
00:01:29.118 --> 00:01:32.578
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She’s a teacher. And Alex is a police officer.

24
00:01:34.034 --> 00:01:36.301
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> They look very young! How old are they?

25
00:01:36.631 --> 00:01:43.522
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She’s 24, and he’s 26, I think. They live in Frankfurt.

26
00:01:44.512 --> 00:01:46.179
We’re very good friends.

27
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:48.746
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Nice pics!

28
00:01:49.121 --> 00:01:53.534
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> Thanks. Can I see some photos of your family?

29
00:01:53.865 --> 00:02:00.080
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Yeah, sure. So this is my…

30
00:02:01.986 --> 00:02:06.550
Sorry, Tanya, I need to go. I have a meeting at half past one.

31
00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:07.661
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> OK.

32
00:02:07.871 --> 00:02:08.651
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Bye.

33
00:02:08.696 --> 00:02:09.747
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> See you later.